<title>UK: CRICKET-ENGLAND 77 ALL OUT V AUSTRALIA IN SECOND TEST - LUNCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND 77 ALL OUT V AUSTRALIA IN SECOND TEST - LUNCH.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>England were all out for 77 at</p>
<p>lunch on the third day of the second test against Australia at</p>
<p>Lord's on Saturday.</p>
</text>
